            "body": "Dear Noah,\n\nYour Form DS-2019 (electronically signed) is ready to download in your Ashworth exchange portal; print it and sign it. Program: Ashworth University exchange, J-1 Student. Begin date 13 January 2027, end date 21 May 2027. SEVIS ID N0034572196.\n\nNext steps:\n1. Pay the I-901 SEVIS fee (USD 220 for J-1 students) online. Pay it at least three business days before your visa interview and bring the receipt.\n2. Complete the DS-160 online visa application. Enter the passport you will present at the interview.\n3. Pay the visa application (MRV) fee, USD 185, and book your interview at the US Embassy in London. A visa integrity fee (USD 250) may be collected when the visa is issued.\n4. At the interview bring: your passport, the signed DS-2019, the DS-160 confirmation page, the I-901 receipt, the MRV fee receipt and evidence of funding.\n\nYour passport must be valid for your whole stay (UK citizens are exempt from the six-month rule). You may enter the US no earlier than 30 days before your begin date, and you have 30 days after your end date to leave.\n\nPre-arrival webinar for spring J-1 students: Thursday 19 November, 11:00-12:00 Eastern Time, online. Please attend live.\n\nInternational Exchange Office, Ashworth University",
